{"title": "Status properties/AllowLeaveDisallowJoinCombat", "pageid": 35349, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Status_properties/AllowLeaveDisallowJoinCombat", "categories": ["Status properties"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">Status properties</a>.</div>\n<p><b>AllowLeaveDisallowJoinCombat</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Status_property\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status property\">status property</a>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"List_of_conditions_with_AllowLeaveDisallowJoinCombat\">List of conditions with AllowLeaveDisallowJoinCombat</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Feigning_Death\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Feigning_Death_(Condition)\" title=\"Feigning Death (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/Feigning_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Feigning_Death_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0f/Feigning_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Feigning_Death_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0f/Feigning_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Feigning_Death_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Feigning Death\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/Feigning_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Feigning_Death_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0f/Feigning_Death_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Feigning_Death_(Condition)\" title=\"Feigning Death (Condition)\">Feigning Death</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Has sunk into a magical coma deep enough to imitate death</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Damage_Types#Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage Types\">Resistant</a> to all damage except <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">Psychic</span></a> damage, and Disease and Poison no longer have any effect</li>\n<li>Removed when <a href=\"/wiki/Help\" title=\"Help\">Helped</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714215646\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.021 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.023 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 327/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 5251/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1043/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.002/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 485513/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   19.907      1 Template:Status_property_page\n100.00%   19.907      1 -total